      "lines": [
        "448. 证明：对于**所指出的变量值**，下列不等式成立：",
        "а) 当 $n>1$ 时，$n^3+1>n^2+n$；",
        "б) 当 $n<-1$ 时，$n^3+1<n^2+n$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "449",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "449. 一架天平，横梁左右两半长度不相等。售货员用它称某",
        "种商品，他先用左盘放物称出一公斤，然后又用右盘放",
        "物称出一公斤，付给同一顾客。问这位顾客得到的商品",
        "是 $2$ 公斤，还是大于或小于 $2$ 公斤？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "450",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "450. 证明：当 $a>0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，下列不等式成立：",
        "а) $\\frac{a}{b^2}+\\frac{b}{a^2}\\geqslant\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}$； б) $(a+b)\\left(\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}\\right)\\geqslant4$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
